<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Clyde half yr shr dips, no div.</title>
<headline>Clyde half yr shr dips, no div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended August 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     3.8	   vs 3.9</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   0.63	  vs 0.65</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   0.87	  vs 1.10</p>
<p>    Tax			 0.20	  vs 0.42</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   1.11	  vs 0.98</p>
<p>    Turnover		  64.31	 vs 68.77</p>
<p>Full name: Clyde Industrial Corp Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Directors said they were confident results for the current financial year would be better than last amid the implementation of more stringent credit control measures and an anticipated improvement in steel trading conditions.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
